    "en": "Citation and commencement"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "1. This Order may be cited as the Interpretation (Price Control (Rice) Order — Fees) Order 2009 and shall come into operation on 15th September 2009."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H2901-A2",
   "no": 2,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "2."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Licence fee"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2. The fee payable to the Price Controller for the issue of a licence to import or carry on any wholesale dealing in any rice which is declared to be a controlled article under the Price Control (Rice) Order (Cap. 244, O 5) shall be $50."
   }
  },
